<x-screen-instructions title="How to use Users">
    <p>Staff accounts — Admin+ only. Set a user's <strong>role</strong> here, which determines everything they can do across the whole panel.</p>
    <p>Use the <strong>Capabilities</strong> tab for a permission that isn't role-based (e.g. Cleaning Crew access) — it's granted independently of rank, to a specific person.</p>
    <p><strong>Behavior Notes Written</strong> shows what this staff member has logged on Active Patrons, for accountability on the notes themselves.</p>
    <p>Role names shown here can be customized per club on the Role Labels settings page — the underlying role and its permissions are unaffected either way.</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
